                        <span class="text-warning fw-bold">🟠</span> The patient's status in the ward will be updated to <strong class="text-warning">Inactive</strong>
                    </li>
                    <li class="list-group-item" style="border: none; padding: 10px 0;">
                        <span class="text-primary">🧾</span> A discharge record will be saved in the system for documentation and reporting
                    </li>
                    <li class="list-group-item" style="border: none; padding: 10px 0;">
